gOa4Q3IcHCGsoEQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_10_TO_30_MIN"],"10 到 30 分鐘",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjM2oD9steWAxV4fPUHHa0gOa4Q3YcHCHAoAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwjM2oD9steWAxV4fPUHHa0gOa4Q3IcHCG8oEg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["在拉麵地圖中士林最高評價的拉麵，今天特別來吃醬油豚骨，價位上是250元在大量接近300上下來說的拉麵，算中價位一些，平常吃日本風味（重鹹）這邊也不外乎選了日本味跟炙燒雞腿肉（另外可選舒肥豬）,粗麵搭配拉麵可以吸附更多的湯頭，上面有三片海苔，一塊炙燒雞腿（薄切）、兩條青江菜跟蔥，份量上一般（加麵要加錢）,沒有筍乾或糖心蛋，肉量也偏薄，還好湯頭夠濃郁，整體吃起來中規中矩，如果不排隊我會考慮來吃，但如果跟以前一樣要排隊，就不用特別等待\n但環境跟服務算是很不錯，店員也很親切，不論離開或點餐時都很熱情，沒有因為名店就怠慢，這點有加分",null,[0,264]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6954279598648027760/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzU1dRd1ZqQmplbWcwV2tac1JsUnJiSEJPTUZKSVRqSjRZVmRJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6954279598648027760/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzU1dRd1ZqQmplbWcwV2tac1JsUnJiSEJPTUZKSVRqSjRZVmRJWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/6954279598648027760/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzU1dRd1ZqQmplbWcwV2tac1JsUnJiSEJPTUZKSVRqSjRZVmRJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6954279598648027760/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzU1dRd1ZqQmplbWcwV2tac1JsUnJiSEJPTUZKSVRqSjRZVmRJWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6954279598648027760/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzU1dRd1ZqQmplbWcwV2tac1JsUnJiSEJPTUZKSVRqSjRZVmRJWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6954279598648027760/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBzU1dRd1ZqQmplbWcwV2tac1JsUnJiSEJPTUZKSVRqSjRZVmRJWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,2973,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psSWQwVjBjemg0WkZsRlRrbHBOMFJITjJ4YVdIYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xd3780288c1b99726!3m1