"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_NO_WAIT"],"不需等候",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjM2oD9steWAxV4fPUHHa0gOa4Q3YcHCLgBKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwjM2oD9steWAxV4fPUHHa0gOa4Q3IcHCLcBKAc",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["\u200b中午來士林店用餐，剛好完全不用排隊就能直接入座。這裡的店面空間比芝山店寬敞許多，坐起來舒服、沒有壓迫感\n\n\u200b鴨白湯拉麵：湯頭上有一層綿密的泡沫，喝起來濃郁順口，帶著鴨肉的甜味。鴨肉切片呈現粉嫩的色澤，口感軟嫩，搭配玉米筍和紫洋蔥碎很解膩\n\n\u200b雞白湯拉麵：湯底醇厚、雞鮮味十足。裡面的舒肥雞肉給得很有誠意，厚實且完全不乾柴，配上糖心蛋和吸滿湯汁的麵條，味道很平衡\n\n\u200b叉燒拼盤：肉控推薦可以加點。盤裡有帶有焦香的炙燒雞腿叉燒，油脂香氣很足，另外還有口感軟嫩的舒肥雞與舒肥豬，一盤就能吃到三種不同的肉質\n\n\u200b整體來說，無論是湯頭還是肉品的表現都很不錯，加上空間大、中午免排隊，用餐體驗很好，會想再回訪",null,[0,119]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6954279598648027760/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB4U21WcVozZE5WemxIV2pOU1IxcHFhSE5UUlU1RlkxVXhkbFJGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6954279598648027760/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB4U21WcVozZE5WemxIV2pOU1IxcHFhSE5UUlU1RlkxVXhkbFJGUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/6954279598648027760/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB4U21WcVozZE5WemxIV2pOU1IxcHFhSE5UUlU1RlkxVXhkbFJGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6954279598648027760/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB4U21WcVozZE5WemxIV2pOU1IxcHFhSE5UUlU1RlkxVXhkbFJGUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6954279598648027760/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB4U21WcVozZE5WemxIV2pOU1IxcHFhSE5UUlU1RlkxVXhkbFJGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6954279598648027760/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjB4U21WcVozZE5WemxIV2pOU1IxcHFhSE5UUlU1RlkxVXhkbFJGUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,1559,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xSmVqZ3dNVzlHWjNSR1pqaHNTRU5FY1UxdlRFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xd3780288c1b99726!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9o